---

<Base locale="en" slug="download" title={meta.title} description={meta.description} application>
  <main id="main"><div class="page-content wrap"><div class="page-heading"><a class="back-link" href="/en/">Hufu home <span aria-hidden="true">/</span></a><h1>Install Hufu on your Mac.</h1><p>Hufu 0.1.0 is available for macOS 15.0+. The installer is signed and notarized by Apple. Verification and installation steps are below.</p></div><section class="install-panel"><div><h2>Hufu 0.1.0</h2><span class="release-status">Preview · unsigned</span><p>Released 2026-10-21. This is an ad-hoc preview build without Apple notarization. Right-click › Open it the first time, or allow it under System Settings › Privacy & Security. Signing and notarization follow once a developer account is available.</p><div class="download-actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/releases/latest">Download · .pkg · 60 MB <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 4v16m-6-6 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></a><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/releases/latest">.zip (no installer)</a></div><p class="resource-meta"><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/releases/latest">SHA256SUMS.txt</a> · <a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/releases">Corresponding source</a> · <a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/releases">GitHub Releases</a> · <a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu">Source repository</a></p><details class="checksum"><summary>SHA-256 · Hufu-0.1.0.pkg</summary><code>5ee20c245b12f1abde3ce3c552232e057952d86443a045dd833d271b68deabaa</code></details></div><img src="/icon.png" width="120" height="120" alt="Hufu"></section><div class="requirements"><div><strong>System</strong><span>macOS 15.0+</span></div><div><strong>Chip</strong><span>App: Apple silicon and Intel (universal binary)</span><span>hufu command-line tool: Apple silicon and Intel</span></div><div><strong>Licence</strong><span>MIT · dependencies keep their licences</span></div></div><section class="prose"><h2>Install step by step.</h2><ol><li>Download the installer and SHA256SUMS.txt from the same folder. Run this command to verify it.<div class="code-block"><pre><code>shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS.txt --ignore-missing</code></pre><button data-copy-code>Copy</button></div></li><li>Double-click the installer and follow the prompts. Or install with Homebrew:<div class="code-block"><pre><code>xattr -d com.apple.quarantine Hufu-0.1.0.pkg</code></pre><button data-copy-code>Copy</button></div></li><li>Open System Settings → Keyboard → Input Sources → Edit…, click + and add Hufu under Chinese, Simplified. If it is missing after the first install, log out and back in.</li></ol><h2>Or build from source.</h2><p>Requires Xcode 26+ and XcodeGen. The script downloads and verifies pinned dependencies, then builds and registers the input method. The build uses ad-hoc signing.</p><div class="code-block"><pre><code>git clone https://github.com/syhily/hufu.git && cd hufu
  bash scripts/install-dev.sh</code></pre><button data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>After an update, macOS starts the input process when you next type. Do not start it manually.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/docs/">Settings and migration <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></section></div></main>
</Base>
